{
  "id": "6a85b2872624b345ee4786b1",
  "title": "タイトルに結論を書く",
  "created": 1787146890,
  "updated": 1787146921,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a85b2872624b345ee4786b1",
      "text": "タイトルに結論を書く",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787146890,
      "updated": 1787146890
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85b28a000000000079fcf3",
      "text": "　[タイトル]には[結論を書く]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787146890,
      "updated": 1787146899
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85b293000000000079fcf4",
      "text": "　記事や文章の要点をタイトルの時点で示す技術",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787146899,
      "updated": 1787146921
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85b293000000000079fcf5",
      "text": "　読者は知りたい情報がそこにあるとすぐに分かり、読むべきかを選択できる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787146899,
      "updated": 1787146916
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85b293000000000079fcf6",
      "text": " [時間を節約できる]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787146899,
      "updated": 1787146899
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85b293000000000079fcf7",
      "text": " [検索しやすい]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787146899,
      "updated": 1787146899
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85b293000000000079fcf8",
      "text": " 期待と内容が一致する",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787146899,
      "updated": 1787146899
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85b293000000000079fcf9",
